No repository-wide open-source license is granted by this preview. Existing rights
in imported project source and external materials remain with their respective
holders. Each project's LICENSE.md records its current scope and status.

Before public distribution, the owner must select applicable licenses for material
they are authorized to license. Dependency licenses and external-data permissions
remain separate. No third-party permissions are created by this repository.
